<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oxford Health raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oxford Health raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Oxford Health Plan Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Oxford gained 2-1/8 to 54-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
